  "job_B8.4.2.2.1_20251003_114834": {
    "text": "\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re fifteo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is sceal on \u00fe\u00e6re wucan \u00e6fter \u00feam \u00fee man belyc\u00f0 alleluia.\n\u00d0is sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re seofe\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal innan h\u00e6refeste to Sancte Iohannes m\u00e6ssan.\n\u00d0is sceal on s\u00e6ternesd\u00e6g \u00e6r halgan d\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feryddan lencten wucan.\n\u00d0is godspel sceal on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00ferytteo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re ehto\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on Sancte Petres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0is sceal on s\u00e6ternd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re forman f\u00e6sten wucan.\n\u00d0is sceal to \u00feam ymbrene innan h\u00e6refeste on wodnesd\u00e6g.\n\u00d0is sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re nygo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re syxtan wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re seofe\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys gebyra\u00f0 on sunnand\u00e6g \u00e6r halgan d\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0ys gebyra\u00f0 feower wucon \u00e6r myddan wintran.\n\u00d0is sceal on \u00feone feor\u00f0an friged\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00fe\u00e6re xxiiii wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re twelftan wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0es passio gebyra\u00f0 on tiwesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re palmwucan.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on easterd\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re o\u00f0ere easter wucan.\n\u00d0is sceal on \u00feunresd\u00e6g innan \u00fe\u00e6re gangwucan.",
